    description: Some("Two agents, Warrior and Fighter, break into Professor Rogue\'s orbital fortress. Each room is a maze of floors, ladders and blocks: smash the energy blocks and collect every capsule, and the robots patrolling the room lose power and vaporise. Blocks and ladder segments can be kicked at them, and ladders once joined cannot be parted again."),
